    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ezekia ha nīmo gwa būlang'hani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūnizīīla hangī gūlīhaya: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wana wa munhū, yombaga nabo a banhū ba sī ya ng'wing'we ūbawīle: Ūlū nūlagīja mhayo gwa kūyagaja banhū gwize mu sī ndebe, hūna a banhū ba sī yenīyo būsola ūmò wabo būntūūla kūbiza nang'hani wabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nang'hwe ūgūbona ū mhayo gwenūyo gūliza kwīkenaagūla ī sī, hūna ūfuula nhaaninga ya kūbahūgūla a banhū; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "munhū ose ose ūlū ūliigwa ī lilaka lya nhaaninga alīyo ūleka ū kūhūgūka hūna ū mhayo gwenūyo gwiza gūnsola, ū lūfu lwakwe akūbalīlwa wei ng'wenekīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno waligwaga ī lilaka lya nhaaninga, alīyo ūleka ū kūhūgūka; ū lūfu lwenūlo akūbalīlwa wei ng'wenekīlī. Alīyo ūlū ni walī wazunya kūhūgūlwa ni wabūpīja ū būpanga wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū nang'hani ūlū ūgūbona ū mhayo gwa kūyagaja banhū gūliza alīyo ūleka ū kwīfuula ī nhaaninga ya kūbahūgūla a banhū, hūna ū mhayo gwenūyo gwiza gūsola būpanga bo ng'wa ose ose ū mubo, ū munhū ng'wenūyo akūsolwa kūlwa shibi shakwe, alīyo ū lūfu lwenūlo nakūng'wisaabīla ū nang'hani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū ng'wana wa munhū, ū bebe nakwītaga kūbiza nang'hani kūlwa numba ya Isilaeli, hūna lūūlū ūkūyūgwigwa ū mhayo ūyo nalīgūhaya wabahūgūla mu būhūgūji bo kūfuma kūlī nene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū wabūbi ūlū nūng'wīla gīkī, “Bebe ūlī wabūbi ūkūcha,” ū bebe ūlū ūtang'hūgūlile nūūlū kūnganikīla gīkī īnge ū mu nzīla jakwe ī jabūbi, abūpīje ū būpanga bokwe, ū munhū wabūbi ng'wenūyo akūchīla mu shibi shakwe",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mu shibi shakwe:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, akūcha kūlwa shibi shakwe.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ng'hana; alīyo nakūkūbalīla bebe ū nsango gwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū munhū wabūbi ng'wenūyo ūlū ūng'hūgūla gīkī agalūke īnge ū mu būbi wakwe nang'hwe ūlema ū kūgalūka ajileke ī nzīla jakwe, akūchīla mu shibi shakwe; gwike ū bebe ūkūbiza wabūpījaga ū būpanga wako.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bebe ng'wana wa munhū, īwīlage ī numba ya Isilaeli: A bing'we mukahayaga gīkī, “Ū būhūbi wise nī shibi shise shitūsheedekegije no, tūkūdūla kinehe ū kwikala tūlī bapanga?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawīlage gīkī, “Ūmo nene nalī mpanga; alīhaya Seeba MULUNGU, kūtaniyejaga ū kūcha kwa banhū babūbi, alīyo īlī hambū hambū bagalūke balekane nī nzīla jabo bapīle. Galūkagi! Galūkagi ng'wīnge ū mu nzīla jing'we ī mbi! Nibūlī nose mushile kūcha bing'we numba ya Isilaeli?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū ng'wana wa munhū, a banhū ba sī ya ng'wing'we bawīlage gīkī, “Ū būtūngīlīja bo munhū ntūngīlīja būtūdūla kūmpīja ūlū ūleka kūbiza ng'wigwi, nūūlū ū būbi wa munhū wabūbi būtūng'wenheleja kūgwa ūlū ūgalūka ūlekana nabo. Ū munhū ntūngīlīja ūlū wīta shibi atūzunīlījiwa kwikala mpanga kūlwa būtūngīlīja bokwe ū bo kale.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū nakang'wīla ū ntūngīlīja gīkī akūbiza mhola alīyo hangī ū wei ūbūsanya ū būtūngīlīja wakwe hūna wīta yabūbi, shose shose īsho washīta mu būtūngīlīja wakwe shitizūkīlwa nūūlū shimò, akūchīla ū mu būbi ūbo alawīte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama nūūlū munhū wabūbi nūng'wīla gīkī, “Ūkūcha ū bebe,” hūna ūgalūka ūlekana nasho ī shibi shakwe, wandya kwīta ya būdeeba na būtūngīlīja, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īsho walī wasola ndiimīli ūshishosha, nūūlū shikolo walī wasola mu būnyeecha ūshishosha, ū ng'wenūyo akūpīla gete atūcha yaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shibi shakwe īsho wīta shitizūkīlwa nūūlū shimò, nguno wītile ya būdeeba na būtūngīlīja; ū ng'wenūyo akūpīla gete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a banhū ba sī ya ng'wing'we bakahayaga, “Ī nzīla ya ng'wa Seeba ītatūngīlīgije,” Gwike ī nzīla yabo h'īyo ītatūngīlīgije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntūngīlīja ūlū ūgalūka ūbūleka ū būtūngīlīja bokwe wīta yabūbi, akūchīla ū mu būbi wenūbo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ū munhū wabūbi nang'hwe ūlū ūgalūka ūbūleka ū būbi bokwe, hūna wīta ya būdeeba na būtūngīlīja, akūbiza mpanga ū mu kwīta gīko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a bing'we numba ya Isilaeli mukūhayaga gīkī, “Ī nzīla ya ng'wa SEEBA ītatūngīlīgije. Nakūmulamula būlī ūmò wing'we kūlenganīla na nzīla jakwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'hūlū ja kūding'wa kwa Yelusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu lūshikū lwa katanò ng'weji gw'ikūmi, ng'waka gw'ikūmi n'ibīlī gwa būsaamiwa wise, akiza munhū ūmò walī wapūlūgūka ūpeela kūfuma Yelusalemu, ūniwīla gīkī ū nzengo gwadimilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū ī igolo yaho ī mhīndī, ū nkono go ng'wa Seeba gwalī hamò nane, ūnilugūla ū nomo gwane aho ataalī kūshika ū munhū ng'wenūyo ī dilū yenīyo. Ū nomo gwane gūbiza gwalugūlwa, būshila ū būnjomba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
