          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūnizīīla gūhaya: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bebe ng'wana wa munhū, a banhū abo basaagīīlile ū kū mapagale ga mu sī ya Isilaeli bakūhayaga gīkī, “Ū Abulahamu walī munhū ūmò dūhū alīyo h'akinhwa ī sī yenīyī kūbiza wingīji bokwe; a bise tūlī bingī no, hū kūhaya twinhilwe dūhū ī sī yenīyī ībize wingīji wise.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū bawīlage, “Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, A bing'we īkī mukalyaga nyama na mininga gajo, hangī musanije shiikolile shing'we sha kūlamiwa, na a banhū mukababūlagaga; muliganika mukūlekwa mubize na wingīji ū mu sī yenīyo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwikumīlījaga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33:26",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mukwikumīlījaga:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shihebulania, mukwikumīlīgījaga līlūshū.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " gīkī mulī na shilanga sha kūmulang'hana, alīyo ū kūnū ng'wīta mihayo y'ipelanya, na būlī ūmò wing'we akūnsosohajaga nke wa ng'wiye; ī sī h'ībize sabo ying'we a bing'we?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:26"
          },
          "items": [
