            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawīlage gīkī, “Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya: Ūmo nene nalī mpanga, abo baalekeelilwe ū kū mapagale bakūmalīījiwa līlūshū; abo baapeelelile kū masaka nakūbinha kū mashiinū gabalye, hama abo balī mu ng'hambī ja kūpīlīla na mu mapilinga bakūbūlagwa mabūsaatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī sī nakwīyīta ībize itogolo lītī na shose shose, hūna ū wikumīlīja kūlwa nguzu jayo būkūshila, hanuma ī ngūlū ja Isilaeli jikūbiza masaka gike atizilonga munhū wa kūbītīla moi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho hū bakūdeeba gīkī ū nene nalī SEEBA, ūlū nīyīta ī sī kūbiza itogolo lītī na shose shose, kūlwa mihayo y'ipelanya pyī īyo bīyīta.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
